WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.165 --> 00:00:01.684
- Oh, he's kissing me.

00:00:01.684 --> 00:00:03.390
Oh, he's kissing me.

00:00:03.390 --> 00:00:05.086
Oh, he's kissing me.

00:00:05.086 --> 00:00:06.409
He loves me.

00:00:06.409 --> 00:00:08.346
And I love him.

00:00:09.264 --> 00:00:10.425
- I've fed ducks before,

00:00:10.425 --> 00:00:13.189
but it doesn't seem
like they appreciate it,

00:00:13.189 --> 00:00:14.802
to be quite honest.

00:00:14.892 --> 00:00:16.970
- I remember one time I tossed a duck

00:00:16.970 --> 00:00:18.434
a whole piece of bread.

00:00:18.434 --> 00:00:20.199
He ate the whole piece of bread.

00:00:20.199 --> 00:00:21.728
- Birds are fine, I guess.

00:00:21.728 --> 00:00:23.225
I don't really have any...

00:00:23.225 --> 00:00:24.468
I don't watch birds.

00:00:24.468 --> 00:00:27.452
- I don't care about ducks.

00:00:27.452 --> 00:00:29.228
- Like, I've seen baby ducks on Instagram,

00:00:29.228 --> 00:00:30.865
and they get mad likes.

00:00:30.865 --> 00:00:32.362
- So let's go meet the duck!

00:00:32.362 --> 00:00:33.720
- I'm nervous.

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:35.103
- I hear him squeaking.

00:00:35.103 --> 00:00:37.033
(deep sigh)

00:00:40.555 --> 00:00:42.616
- Oh my God, this is pretty awesome.

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:46.774
- Whoa.

00:00:49.267 --> 00:00:50.329
- Be quiet, you guys.

00:00:50.329 --> 00:00:52.164
You don't want to scare him.

00:00:52.164 --> 00:00:53.929
- Nom, nom, nom, nom, nom...

00:00:56.959 --> 00:00:58.064
(laugh)

00:00:58.314 --> 00:00:59.107
- Huh!

00:00:59.169 --> 00:01:01.198
- Oh, oh, oh, oh.

00:01:03.355 --> 00:01:05.787
- So soft and so brittle.

00:01:06.144 --> 00:01:08.244
- Alright, it's pretty (bleep) cute.

00:01:10.566 --> 00:01:12.292
- He yawned!

00:01:12.292 --> 00:01:14.294
- Oh! He sneezed!

00:01:18.641 --> 00:01:21.330
- This duck is just full of surprises.

00:01:21.330 --> 00:01:23.090
- Wait 'til he starts looking.

00:01:25.727 --> 00:01:26.743
(camera click)

00:01:27.194 --> 00:01:29.025
- Oh, God! He's doing stuff.

00:01:29.025 --> 00:01:31.207
- I need, I need... (bleep)

00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:34.648
- You guys saw him yawn.

00:01:34.648 --> 00:01:35.756
He was doing it again.

00:01:35.756 --> 00:01:37.265
- I feel like I'm a jerk.

00:01:37.265 --> 00:01:38.878
Sorry I was so...

00:01:39.693 --> 00:01:42.801
I was just not used to
seeing little, baby animals.

00:01:43.857 --> 00:01:45.157
He's a little baby guy.

00:01:45.959 --> 00:01:48.211
- I'm not ready to have a duck.

00:01:48.211 --> 00:01:50.579
- Like, I'd be nervous to turn
on a lightswitch right now.

00:01:50.579 --> 00:01:52.181
- I feel happier.

00:01:52.181 --> 00:01:54.061
The rest of my day is gonna be better.

00:01:54.061 --> 00:01:55.756
- Life is a miracle.

00:01:55.756 --> 00:01:58.497
It's a miracle that we all
evolved from little things.

00:01:58.497 --> 00:02:01.678
But you see it, and just
you want it to be okay.

00:02:01.678 --> 00:02:03.080
Can I hold him again, actually?

00:02:03.814 --> 00:02:06.738
(upbeat music)

00:02:07.877 --> 00:02:09.433
- He made some peeping noises.

00:02:09.433 --> 00:02:10.918
Listen to him!

00:02:10.918 --> 00:02:12.139
He goes "peep, peep!"

00:02:12.370 --> 00:02:14.140
He goes "peep, peep!"

